EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yesterday was {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Girl's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
It really passed by in a flash!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I can't wait for it to come again!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ayer fue el Día de la Niña.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Se me pasó volando!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Pero el año que viene hay otro!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ieri era la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festa delle bambole{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Accifuffoli... È passata in un baleno!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Già non vedo l'ora che ritorni!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kızlar Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ydü.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Göz açıp kapayıncaya kadar
geçti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bir daha gelmesini sabırsızlıkla bekliyorum!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir sonraki {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kızlar Gününü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
beklediğimiz bu yıl boyunca hem kızların hem
de erkeklerin sağlıklı büyümesini diliyorum.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No importa lo mayor que me haga,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡cada año me sigue emocionando
el Día de la Niña!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Anche se ormai sono grandicella,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
mi emoziono ancora tantissimo
per la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festa delle bambole{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kaç yaşına gelirsem geleyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kızlar
Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} beni hep heyecanlandırıyor!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Alors là !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} J'en reste bouche bée...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vous ressemblez à l'empereur
Odairisama, {{TAG:0003:0005:}}façon poupée !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, my goodness!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} How lovely!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You look just like the Ohinasama
on top of a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Girl's Day {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}doll display!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nom d'un chignon ! Quelle beauté !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vous ressemblez à l'impératrice
Ohinasama, {{TAG:0003:0005:}}façon poupée !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aman tanrım!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Ne kadar hoş!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kızlar Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} hina bebeklerinin
tepesindeki Ohinasama gibisin!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}It looks so good on you!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Thank you for taking time to come
all this way to celebrate {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Girl's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
with us!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ça vous va à ravir !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci d'avoir fait tout ce chemin
pour célébrer la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fête des poupées{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
avec nous.

EN:
